{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and existing tests, make a minimal fix, and run the tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller let every completed request update state. I added a request counter so only the latest search can do that. Clearing the query also advances the counter, invalidating pending requests. The existing tests cover normal behavior; I’ll also run an in-memory race-condition check without modifying tests.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts so only the latest search updates results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification passed: npm test, all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race-condition probe; git diff --check. Exit code 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed. No blockers.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts so only the latest search updates results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification passed: npm test, all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race-condition probe; git diff --check. Exit code 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed. No blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":6,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a; find . -name AGENTS.md -not -path './node_modules/*' -not -path './.git/*' ","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/search-3-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":197,"stdout_bytes":117,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-dba53c55e3e21b4a2af9fa5da2a13173.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test && node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = [{ id: 'new', title: 'Latest', url: '/latest' }];\nfor (const finishOld of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const scenario of ['pending', 'completed', 'cleared']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const current = c.search('new');\n    if (scenario === 'completed') { requests[1].resolve(items); await current; }\n    if (scenario === 'cleared') {\n      await c.search('  ');\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n    }\n    const before = c.getState();\n    requests[0][finishOld](finishOld === 'resolve' ? items : new Error('stale'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n    if (scenario !== 'completed') { requests[1].resolve(items); await current; }\n    if (scenario === 'cleared') assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n    else assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'new', results: items, loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('Race-condition probe passed: stale success/failure while pending, completed, and cleared.');\nNODE\n git diff --check; git diff --stat; git diff -- src/search/controller.ts; git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/search-3-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":374,"stdout_bytes":2318,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-9183bc240ea38d30968142f075c07247.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":49214,"output_tokens":1000},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":11648,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":11}}
